a CloudKit re-hydrate action).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","isActive":true},{"text":" for that path — it records no changes and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange"},{"text":" fires for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app its own writes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot represent duplicates — ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" holds one index per ID — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index while the array kept every copy, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" over-reports and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry at all,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaving a row that is visible in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" but invisible to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/init(_:)":{"title":"init(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch)."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swidux","title":"Swidux"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/contains(_:)":{"title":"contains(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contains","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool